I’m going to patch the functional runner so FN-4 gets the same GDR-mode restart in full-suite runs that dashboard run-one already gets. I’ll also tighten waiver semantics: WAIVED will remain a distinct status, but it will no longer be counted as a pass, and FN-4 will fail when GDR-capable hardware is present but the stack was not started/built in GDR mode.
