codex
FN-5 is failing on an index propagation race, not on the RDMA route write itself: `RPC_ROUTE_PUT` reports a non-degraded RDMA write to the peer slab, then the immediate peer readback sometimes asks before the RDMA SEND metadata update has been processed. I’ll make the checker wait briefly for that metadata to become visible instead of treating the first miss as final.
apply patch
